Date: Fri, 27 Mar 2026 11:17:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat: complete clean architecture migration for all
 remaining routes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Migrated all remaining raw SQL queries from routes to Repository → Service pattern:

Admin routes (admin_db_wired.py):
- create_resource, create_contact, list_assessment_questions, create_assessment_question

AI Reporting routes (ai_reporting_db_wired.py):
- generate_clinical_synthesis, patient_ai_chat
- New: AiReportingRepositoryDbReal, AiReportingServiceDb

Appointments routes (appointments_db_wired.py):
- create_appointment, update_appointment_status

Homework routes (homework_db_wired.py):
- create_homework, submit_homework_feedback

Care Plans routes (careplans_db_wired.py):
- get_active_careplan (with phases)

Assessments routes (assessments_db_wired.py):
- list_assessment_templates

All routes now follow: Route → Service → Repository → DB pool
Zero raw queries remain in any route file.
